WEBVTT

00:00:01.049 --> 00:00:01.676
Percy: GRYFFINDORS,
FOLLOW ME, PLEASE.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.417
KEEP UP. THANK YOU.

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.898
RAVENCLAW,
FOLLOW ME.

00:00:05.941 --> 00:00:08.117
THIS WAY.

00:00:08.161 --> 00:00:10.337
THIS IS
THE MOST DIRECT PATH

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.555
TO THE DORMITORIES.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:13.601
OH, AND KEEP AN EYE
ON THE STAIRCASES.

00:00:13.645 --> 00:00:15.516
THEY LIKE TO CHANGE.

00:00:25.004 --> 00:00:28.224
KEEP UP, PLEASE,
AND FOLLOW ME.

00:00:28.268 --> 00:00:29.704
QUICKLY, NOW.
COME ON.

00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:31.445
COME ON.

00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:33.839
Neville: SEAMUS,
THAT PICTURE'S MOVING!

00:00:33.882 --> 00:00:35.536
Ron: LOOK AT
THAT ONE, HARRY.

00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:37.146
Harry: I THINK
SHE FANCIES YOU.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:39.801
[STUDENTS CHATTERING]

00:00:39.845 --> 00:00:42.021
Girl: OH, LOOK! LOOK!
WHO'S THAT GIRL?

00:00:42.064 --> 00:00:44.763
Man in painting:
WELCOME TO HOGWARTS.

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:47.635
WHO'S THAT?

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.476
PASSWORD?

00:01:02.519 --> 00:01:04.913
CAPUT DRACONIS.

00:01:07.394 --> 00:01:08.656
WOW!

00:01:12.181 --> 00:01:14.183
Percy:
FOLLOW ME, EVERYONE.

00:01:14.227 --> 00:01:16.272
KEEP UP.
QUICKLY, COME ON.

00:01:18.187 --> 00:01:19.841
Girl: OH, WOW!

00:01:19.885 --> 00:01:21.495
Percy:
GATHER 'ROUND HERE.

00:01:23.802 --> 00:01:27.327
WELCOME TO THE
GRYFFINDOR COMMON ROOM.

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:30.156
BOYS' DORMITORIES, UPSTAIRS
AND DOWN TO YOUR LEFT,

00:01:30.199 --> 00:01:31.984
GIRLS', THE SAME
ON YOUR RIGHT.

00:01:32.027 --> 00:01:33.550
YOU'LL FIND
ALL YOUR BELONGINGS

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:35.378
HAVE ALREADY BEEN
BROUGHT UP.

00:02:42.576 --> 00:02:45.013
WHEW. MADE IT.

00:02:45.057 --> 00:02:46.319
CAN YOU IMAGINE
THE LOOK

00:02:46.362 --> 00:02:46.381
ON OLD McGONAGALL'S FACE
IF WE WERE LATE?

